     A*
     A* - Ancillary Medical Billing Transaction File
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 04/05/2011 by c:198 for Project 45MHZ
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from Ancillary.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PC901                     TEXT('Ancillary Billing File')
     A            C9DCID    R               REFFLD(DCID)
     A                                      COLHDG('IMPORT Doc ID')
     A            C9MBR#    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('FAN0P file member')
     A            C9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A            C9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            C9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from FAC0P
     A*           member to FAC1P
     A*
     A            C9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            C9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Processed Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAC1P records have a value
     A*           in C1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the Import document from being processed again.
     A*
     A            C9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Processed Time')
     A*
     A            C9CNT     R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Bills Count')
     A            C9TRCT    R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Records' 'Processed')
     A            C9DUP     R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Duplicate' 'Records')
     A            C9ERR     R               REFFLD(A90)
     A                                      COLHDG('Total Bills' 'With Errors')
     A            C9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            C9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            C9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            C9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            C9DT      R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            C9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            C9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            C9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            C9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
